sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as App UI (Hilo Principal)
    participant Worker as IMAP Worker (Goroutine)
    participant Idler as IMAP Idler (Sub-Goroutine)
    participant Server as Servidor IMAP

    UI->>Worker: PostAction(FetchDirectoryContents)
    Worker->>Idler: Stop() — libera conexión
    Worker->>Server: UID FETCH 1:* (FLAGS ENVELOPE)
    Server-->>Worker: Lista de mensajes
    Worker->>UI: PostMessage(DirectoryContents{uids})
    Worker->>UI: PostMessage(MessageInfo{...}) x N
    Worker->>UI: PostMessage(Done)
    Worker->>Idler: Start() — vuelve a IDLE con debounce

    Idler->>Server: IDLE (blocking)
    Note over Idler,Server: Conexión TCP bloqueada esperando...

    Server-->>Idler: * 101 EXISTS (nuevo mensaje)
    Idler->>Worker: updates chan ← MailboxUpdate
    Worker->>UI: PostMessage(CheckMail → MessageInfo nuevo)
    UI-->>UI: Redibuja lista con nuevo correo
